{"slug": "shooter", "name": "우주 슈팅", "keywords": ["슈팅", "shooting", "슈터", "우주선", "운석 피하기", "space shooter", "비행기 게임"], "prompt": "탑다운 우주선 슈팅 게임을 만들어줘. 좌우 이동·자동 발사, 운석과 적기 웨이브, 목숨 3개, 점수, 보스 1종, 파워업(연사) 하나, 게임오버·재시작.", "description": "탑다운 우주선 슈팅 게임을 만들었어. 좌우 이동(키보드/터치 버튼) + 자동 발사, 운석·적기 웨이브(점점 어려워짐), 5웨이브마다 보스 등장, 연사 파워업(R 아이콘), 목숨 3개(피격 시 무적시간), 점수/웨이브 표시, 게임오버 후 재시작 버튼까지 모두 구현했어. 반응형 캔버스 스케일링과 모바일 좌우 터치 버튼도 포함되어 있어.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head><script>(function(){var t0=Date.now();function post(n,d){try{parent.postMessage({type:'aj:event',name:String(n),data:d==null?null:d,t:Date.now()-t0},'*')}catch(e){}}window.AJ={event:post,start:function(d){post('start',d)},score:function(s){post('score',{score:Number(s)||0})},over:function(s){post('over',{score:Number(s)||0})},level:function(l){post('level',{level:l})},restart:function(){post('restart')}};window.addEventListener('load',function(){post('load')});var first=false;['keydown','pointerdown','touchstart'].forEach(function(ev){window.addEventListener(ev,function(){if(!first){first=true;post('first_input')}},{passive:true})});})();</script><script>try{window.localStorage.getItem('__t')}catch(e){(function(){var m={};var s={getItem:function(k){return k in m?m[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){m[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete m[k]},clear:function(){m={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(m)[i]||null},get length(){return Object.keys(m).length}};try{Object.defineProperty(window,'localStorage',{value:s,configurable:true})}catch(_){}try{Object.defineProperty(window,'sessionStorage',{value:s,configurable:true})}catch(_){}})()}</script>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n<title>스타 디펜더</title>\n<style>\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#000;overflow:hidden;width:100%;height:100%;\n    -webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;touch-action:none;}\n  #wrap{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#000;}\n  canvas{background:#02020a;display:block;touch-action:none;}\n  #touchUI{position:fixed;left:0;bottom:0;width:100%;pointer-events:none;display:none;z-index:5;}\n  .tbtn{\n    position:fixed;bottom:4vh;width:15vh;height:15vh;min-width:64px;min-height:64px;max-width:110px;max-height:110px;\n    border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:32px;color:#fff;\n    pointer-events:auto;user-select:none;\n  }\n  #btnLeft{left:4vw;}\n  #btnRight{right:4vw;}\n  .tbtn:active{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);}\n  #overlay{\n    position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:none;\n    align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;\n    background:rgba(0,0,0,0.75);color:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;z-index:10;text-align:center;\n  }\n  #overlay h1{font-size:min(8vw,48px);margin:0 0 10px 0;color:#ff5050;}\n  #overlay p{font-size:min(5vw,22px);margin:4px;}\n  #restartBtn{\n    margin-top:20px;padding:12px 30px;font-size:min(5vw,22px);border-radius:10px;border:none;\n    background:#2ecbff;color:#001;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"wrap\">\n  <canvas id=\"game\"></canvas>\n</div>\n<div id=\"touchUI\">\n  <div class=\"tbtn\" id=\"btnLeft\">◀</div>\n  <div class=\"tbtn\" id=\"btnRight\">▶</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"overlay\">\n  <h1>GAME OVER</h1>\n  <p id=\"finalScore\">점수: 0</p>\n  <p id=\"finalWave\">웨이브: 1</p>\n  <button id=\"restartBtn\">다시 시작</button>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\nconst W = 480, H = 800;\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('game');\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\nfunction resize(){\n  const scale = Math.min(window.innerWidth/W, window.innerHeight/H);\n  canvas.width = W; canvas.height = H;\n  canvas.style.width = (W*scale)+'px';\n  canvas.style.height = (H*scale)+'px';\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', resize);\nresize();\n\n// touch detection\nconst isTouch = ('ontouchstart' in window) || navigator.maxTouchPoints>0;\nif(isTouch){\n  document.getElementById('touchUI').style.display='block';\n}\n\n// ---------- input ----------\nlet keyLeft=false, keyRight=false;\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{\n  if(e.key==='ArrowLeft'||e.key==='a'||e.key==='A') keyLeft=true;\n  if(e.key==='ArrowRight'||e.key==='d'||e.key==='D') keyRight=true;\n});\nwindow.addEventListener('keyup', e=>{\n  if(e.key==='ArrowLeft'||e.key==='a'||e.key==='A') keyLeft=false;\n  if(e.key==='ArrowRight'||e.key==='d'||e.key==='D') keyRight=false;\n});\n\nconst btnLeft = document.getElementById('btnLeft');\nconst btnRight = document.getElementById('btnRight');\nfunction bindTouchBtn(el, onDown, onUp){\n  el.addEventListener('touchstart', e=>{e.preventDefault(); onDown();}, {passive:false});\n  el.addEventListener('touchend', e=>{e.preventDefault(); onUp();}, {passive:false});\n  el.addEventListener('touchcancel', e=>{e.preventDefault(); onUp();}, {passive:false});\n  el.addEventListener('mousedown', e=>{e.preventDefault(); onDown();});\n  el.addEventListener('mouseup', e=>{e.preventDefault(); onUp();});\n  el.addEventListener('mouseleave', e=>{onUp();});\n}\nbindTouchBtn(btnLeft, ()=>keyLeft=true, ()=>keyLeft=false);\nbindTouchBtn(btnRight, ()=>keyRight=true, ()=>keyRight=false);\n\n// ---------- game state ----------\nlet state = 'playing'; // playing / gameover\nlet score = 0;\nlet wave = 1;\nlet lives = 3;\nlet invulTimer = 0;\n\nconst player = {\n  x: W/2, y: H-90, w: 28, h: 34, speed: 320,\n  fireCooldown:0, fireRate:0.28, rapidTimer:0\n};\n\nlet bullets = [];      // player bullets\nlet enemyBullets = [];\nlet meteors = [];\nlet enemies = [];\nlet powerups = [];\nlet particles = [];\nlet boss = null;\n\nlet spawnQueue = []; // functions to spawn over time\nlet spawnTimer = 0;\nlet waveBreakTimer = 0;\nlet waveMessage = \"\";\nlet waveMessageTimer = 0;\n\nfunction showMessage(msg, t){\n  waveMessage = msg; waveMessageTimer = t;\n}\n\nfunction startWave(w){\n  wave = w;\n  if(wave % 5 === 0){\n    // boss wave\n    showMessage(\"WARNING: BOSS 접근!\", 2.2);\n    spawnQueue = [];\n    setTimeout(()=>{ if(state==='playing') spawnBoss(); }, 1800);\n  } else {\n    showMessage(\"WAVE \" + wave, 1.6);\n    const meteorCount = 3 + wave*2;\n    const enemyCount = Math.min(2 + Math.floor(wave*1.2), 14);\n    spawnQueue = [];\n    for(let i=0;i<meteorCount;i++) spawnQueue.push({type:'meteor', delay: i*0.5});\n    for(let i=0;i<enemyCount;i++) spawnQueue.push({type:'enemy', delay: 0.4 + i*0.65});\n    // sort by delay cumulative handled via timer accumulation below\n    spawnQueue.sort((a,b)=>a.delay-b.delay);\n    spawnTimer = 0;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction spawnMeteor(){\n  const r = 14 + Math.random()*16;\n  meteors.push({\n    x: 30 + Math.random()*(W-60),\n    y: -r-10,\n    r: r,\n    vy: 60 + Math.random()*70 + wave*4,\n    vx: (Math.random()-0.5)*40,\n    hp: r>24?2:1,\n    rot: Math.random()*10,\n    rotSpeed:(Math.random()-0.5)*2\n  });\n}\n\nfunction spawnEnemy(){\n  enemies.push({\n    x: 40 + Math.random()*(W-80),\n    y: -30,\n    w:26,h:22,\n    vy: 50 + Math.random()*40 + wave*3,\n    baseX: null,\n    t: Math.random()*10,\n    amp: 40+Math.random()*60,\n    hp: 1 + Math.floor(wave/4),\n    shootCd: 1+Math.random()*1.5\n  });\n}\n\nfunction spawnBoss(){\n  boss = {\n    x: W/2, y: 110, w: 120, h: 80,\n    hp: 80 + wave*16, maxHp: 80+wave*16,\n    dir: 1, speed: 90 + wave*2,\n    shootCd: 1.1, phaseCd: 0\n  };\n  showMessage(\"BOSS!\", 1.4);\n}\n\nfunction dropPowerupMaybe(x,y){\n  if(Math.random() < 0.12){\n    powerups.push({x,y,vy:80, r:12});\n  }\n}\n\nfunction spawnExplosion(x,y,color,count){\n  for(let i=0;i<count;i++){\n    const a = Math.random()*Math.PI*2;\n    const sp = 40+Math.random()*140;\n    particles.push({x,y,vx:Math.cos(a)*sp,vy:Math.sin(a)*sp,life:0.4+Math.random()*0.4,color});\n  }\n}\n\nfunction resetGame(){\n  score=0; wave=0; lives=3; invulTimer=1.0;\n  player.x=W/2; player.y=H-90; player.fireCooldown=0; player.rapidTimer=0;\n  bullets=[]; enemyBullets=[]; meteors=[]; enemies=[]; powerups=[]; particles=[];\n  boss=null; spawnQueue=[]; spawnTimer=0; waveBreakTimer=0;\n  state='playing';\n  document.getElementById('overlay').style.display='none';\n  startWave(1);\n}\n\n// ---------- collision helper ----------\nfunction dist2(x1,y1,x2,y2){ const dx=x1-x2, dy=y1-y2; return dx*dx+dy*dy; }\n\n// ---------- update ----------\nlet lastTime = performance.now();\nfunction loop(now){\n  let dt = (now - lastTime)/1000;\n  if(dt>0.05) dt=0.05;\n  lastTime = now;\n  if(state==='playing') update(dt);\n  draw();\n  requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n}\n\nfunction update(dt){\n  if(invulTimer>0) invulTimer -= dt;\n  if(waveMessageTimer>0) waveMessageTimer -= dt;\n\n  // player movement\n  if(keyLeft) player.x -= player.speed*dt;\n  if(keyRight) player.x += player.speed*dt;\n  player.x = Math.max(20, Math.min(W-20, player.x));\n\n  // rapid powerup timer\n  if(player.rapidTimer>0) player.rapidTimer -= dt;\n  const curFireRate = player.rapidTimer>0 ? 0.09 : 0.28;\n\n  // auto fire\n  player.fireCooldown -= dt;\n  if(player.fireCooldown<=0){\n    player.fireCooldown = curFireRate;\n    if(player.rapidTimer>0){\n      bullets.push({x:player.x-8,y:player.y-18,vy:-520});\n      bullets.push({x:player.x+8,y:player.y-18,vy:-520});\n    } else {\n      bullets.push({x:player.x,y:player.y-20,vy:-480});\n    }\n  }\n\n  // spawn queue processing\n  if(!boss){\n    spawnTimer += dt;\n    while(spawnQueue.length>0 && spawnQueue[0].delay <= spawnTimer){\n      const item = spawnQueue.shift();\n      if(item.type==='meteor') spawnMeteor();\n      else if(item.type==='enemy') spawnEnemy();\n    }\n    if(spawnQueue.length===0 && meteors.length===0 && enemies.length===0 && !boss){\n      waveBreakTimer += dt;\n      if(waveBreakTimer > 1.2){\n        waveBreakTimer = 0;\n        startWave(wave+1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // bullets update\n  for(let i=bullets.length-1;i>=0;i--){\n    const b=bullets[i];\n    b.y += b.vy*dt;\n    if(b.y < -20) bullets.splice(i,1);\n  }\n  for(let i=enemyBullets.length-1;i>=0;i--){\n    const b=enemyBullets[i];\n    b.x += (b.vx||0)*dt;\n    b.y += b.vy*dt;\n    if(b.y>H+20||b.y<-20||b.x<-20||b.x>W+20) enemyBullets.splice(i,1);\n  }\n\n  // meteors update\n  for(let i=meteors.length-1;i>=0;i--){\n    const m = meteors[i];\n    m.x += m.vx*dt;\n    m.y += m.vy*dt;\n    m.rot += m.rotSpeed*dt;\n    if(m.x<m.r) {m.x=m.r; m.vx*=-1;}\n    if(m.x>W-m.r) {m.x=W-m.r; m.vx*=-1;}\n    if(m.y > H+40){ meteors.splice(i,1); continue; }\n    // collide with player\n    if(invulTimer<=0 && dist2(m.x,m.y,player.x,player.y) < (m.r+14)*(m.r+14)){\n      meteors.splice(i,1);\n      spawnExplosion(m.x,m.y,'#999',14);\n      hitPlayer();\n      continue;\n    }\n    // collide with bullets\n    for(let j=bullets.length-1;j>=0;j--){\n      const b=bullets[j];\n      if(dist2(b.x,b.y,m.x,m.y) < (m.r+4)*(m.r+4)){\n        bullets.splice(j,1);\n        m.hp--;\n        spawnExplosion(b.x,b.y,'#ffcc66',4);\n        if(m.hp<=0){\n          score += m.r>24?20:10;\n          spawnExplosion(m.x,m.y,'#bbb',18);\n          dropPowerupMaybe(m.x,m.y);\n          meteors.splice(i,1);\n        }\n        break;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // enemies update\n  for(let i=enemies.length-1;i>=0;i--){\n    const e = enemies[i];\n    e.t += dt;\n    if(e.baseX===null) e.baseX = e.x;\n    e.y += e.vy*dt;\n    e.x = e.baseX + Math.sin(e.t*2)*e.amp*0.3;\n    e.x = Math.max(20, Math.min(W-20, e.x));\n    e.shootCd -= dt;\n    if(e.shootCd<=0 && e.y>0 && e.y<H-60){\n      e.shootCd = 1.4 + Math.random()*1.2;\n      const dx = player.x - e.x, dy = player.y - e.y;\n      const len = Math.hypot(dx,dy)||1;\n      enemyBullets.push({x:e.x,y:e.y+10,vx:(dx/len)*220,vy:(dy/len)*220});\n    }\n    if(e.y>H+40){ enemies.splice(i,1); continue; }\n    if(invulTimer<=0 && dist2(e.x,e.y,player.x,player.y) < 22*22){\n      enemies.splice(i,1);\n      spawnExplosion(e.x,e.y,'#ff6666',16);\n      hitPlayer();\n      continue;\n    }\n    for(let j=bullets.length-1;j>=0;j--){\n      const b=bullets[j];\n      if(dist2(b.x,b.y,e.x,e.y) < 18*18){\n        bullets.splice(j,1);\n        e.hp--;\n        spawnExplosion(b.x,b.y,'#ffcc66',4);\n        if(e.hp<=0){\n          score += 25;\n          spawnExplosion(e.x,e.y,'#ff6666',18);\n          dropPowerupMaybe(e.x,e.y);\n          enemies.splice(i,1);\n        }\n        break;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // enemy bullets vs player\n  for(let i=enemyBullets.length-1;i>=0;i--){\n    const b = enemyBullets[i];\n    if(invulTimer<=0 && dist2(b.x,b.y,player.x,player.y) < 14*14){\n      enemyBullets.splice(i,1);\n      hitPlayer();\n    }\n  }\n\n  // boss update\n  if(boss){\n    boss.x += boss.dir*boss.speed*dt;\n    if(boss.x < 80){ boss.x=80; boss.dir=1; }\n    if(boss.x > W-80){ boss.x=W-80; boss.dir=-1; }\n    if(boss.y < 110) boss.y += 60*dt;\n\n    boss.shootCd -= dt;\n    if(boss.shootCd<=0){\n      boss.shootCd = 0.9;\n      const n = 5;\n      for(let k=0;k<n;k++){\n        const ang = Math.PI/2 + (k-(n-1)/2)*0.28;\n        enemyBullets.push({x:boss.x, y:boss.y+30, vx:Math.cos(ang)*220, vy:Math.sin(ang)*220});\n      }\n    }\n    // collide with player bullets\n    for(let j=bullets.length-1;j>=0;j--){\n      const b=bullets[j];\n      if(b.x>boss.x-boss.w/2 && b.x<boss.x+boss.w/2 && b.y>boss.y-boss.h/2 && b.y<boss.y+boss.h/2){\n        bullets.splice(j,1);\n        boss.hp--;\n        spawnExplosion(b.x,b.y,'#ffcc66',3);\n        if(boss.hp<=0){\n          score += 500;\n          spawnExplosion(boss.x,boss.y,'#ff66ff',40);\n          boss = null;\n          showMessage(\"BOSS 격파! +500\", 2.0);\n          setTimeout(()=>{ if(state==='playing') startWave(wave+1); }, 1500);\n          break;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    if(boss && invulTimer<=0){\n      if(player.x>boss.x-boss.w/2-14 && player.x<boss.x+boss.w/2+14 &&\n         player.y>boss.y-boss.h/2-14 && player.y<boss.y+boss.h/2+14){\n        hitPlayer();\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // powerups\n  for(let i=powerups.length-1;i>=0;i--){\n    const p = powerups[i];\n    p.y += p.vy*dt;\n    if(p.y>H+20){ powerups.splice(i,1); continue; }\n    if(dist2(p.x,p.y,player.x,player.y) < (p.r+14)*(p.r+14)){\n      player.rapidTimer = 8;\n      powerups.splice(i,1);\n      showMessage(\"연사 파워업!\", 1.2);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // particles\n  for(let i=particles.length-1;i>=0;i--){\n    const p = particles[i];\n    p.x += p.vx*dt; p.y += p.vy*dt;\n    p.life -= dt;\n    p.vx *= 0.94; p.vy *= 0.94;\n    if(p.life<=0) particles.splice(i,1);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction hitPlayer(){\n  if(invulTimer>0) return;\n  lives--;\n  invulTimer = 1.6;\n  spawnExplosion(player.x, player.y, '#66ccff', 20);\n  if(lives<=0){\n    gameOver();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction gameOver(){\n  state='gameover';\n  document.getElementById('finalScore').textContent = '점수: ' + score;\n  document.getElementById('finalWave').textContent = '웨이브: ' + wave;\n  document.getElementById('overlay').style.display='flex';\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('restartBtn').addEventListener('click', resetGame);\n\n// ---------- draw ----------\nfunction drawShip(x,y,flicker){\n  if(flicker && Math.floor(performance.now()/100)%2===0) return;\n  ctx.save();\n  ctx.translate(x,y);\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.moveTo(0,-18);\n  ctx.lineTo(14,16);\n  ctx.lineTo(0,8);\n  ctx.lineTo(-14,16);\n  ctx.closePath();\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#3fd0ff';\n  ctx.fill();\n  ctx.strokeStyle='#eafcff';\n  ctx.lineWidth=1.5;\n  ctx.stroke();\n  // engine glow\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.arc(0,14,5,0,Math.PI*2);\n  ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,180,60,0.8)';\n  ctx.fill();\n  ctx.restore();\n}\n\nfunction draw(){\n  ctx.clearRect(0,0,W,H);\n  // starfield background\n  drawStars();\n\n  // meteors\n  for(const m of meteors){\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.translate(m.x,m.y);\n    ctx.rotate(m.rot);\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(0,0,m.r,0,Math.PI*2);\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#8a8a8a';\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.strokeStyle='#555';\n    ctx.lineWidth=2;\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(m.r*0.3,-m.r*0.2,m.r*0.25,0,Math.PI*2);\n    ctx.fillStyle='#666';\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  // enemies\n  for(const e of enemies){\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.translate(e.x,e.y);\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(0,14);\n    ctx.lineTo(13,-12);\n    ctx.lineTo(0,-4);\n    ctx.lineTo(-13,-12);\n    ctx.closePath();\n    ctx.fillStyle='#ff5c5c';\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.strokeStyle='#ffd0d0';\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  // boss\n  if(boss){\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.translate(boss.x, boss.y);\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(-boss.w/2, -boss.h/4);\n    ctx.lineTo(-boss.w/4, -boss.h/2);\n    ctx.lineTo(boss.w/4, -boss.h/2);\n    ctx.lineTo(boss.w/2, -boss.h/4);\n    ctx.lineTo(boss.w/2, boss.h/3);\n    ctx.lineTo(0, boss.h/2);\n    ctx.lineTo(-boss.w/2, boss.h/3);\n    ctx.closePath();\n    ctx.fillStyle='#c860ff';\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.strokeStyle='#f0d0ff';\n    ctx.lineWidth=2;\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.restore();\n    // hp bar\n    const barW = 300;\n    ctx.fillStyle='#333';\n    ctx.fillRect(W/2-barW/2, 20, barW, 12);\n    ctx.fillStyle='#ff66ff';\n    ctx.fillRect(W/2-barW/2, 20, barW*Math.max(0,boss.hp/boss.maxHp), 12);\n    ctx.strokeStyle='#fff';\n    ctx.strokeRect(W/2-barW/2,20,barW,12);\n  }\n\n  // bullets\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#7ef7ff';\n  for(const b of bullets){\n    ctx.fillRect(b.x-2, b.y-8, 4, 14);\n  }\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#ff8844';\n  for(const b of enemyBullets){\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(b.x,b.y,4,0,Math.PI*2);\n    ctx.fill();\n  }\n\n  // powerups\n  for(const p of powerups){\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.translate(p.x,p.y);\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.arc(0,0,p.r,0,Math.PI*2);\n    ctx.fillStyle='#ffe066';\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.strokeStyle='#fff';\n    ctx.stroke();\n    ctx.fillStyle='#553300';\n    ctx.font='bold 14px sans-serif';\n    ctx.textAlign='center';\n    ctx.textBaseline='middle';\n    ctx.fillText('R',0,1);\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  // particles\n  for(const p of particles){\n    ctx.globalAlpha = Math.max(0,p.life*2);\n    ctx.fillStyle = p.color;\n    ctx.fillRect(p.x-2,p.y-2,4,4);\n    ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n  }\n\n  // player\n  if(state==='playing'){\n    const flicker = invulTimer>0;\n    drawShip(player.x, player.y, flicker);\n  }\n\n  // HUD\n  ctx.textAlign='left';\n  ctx.textBaseline='top';\n  ctx.font='bold 22px sans-serif';\n  ctx.fillStyle='#fff';\n  ctx.fillText('점수: '+score, 14, 14);\n  ctx.font='bold 16px sans-serif';\n  ctx.fillText('웨이브: '+wave, 14, 42);\n\n  // lives icons\n  for(let i=0;i<lives;i++){\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.translate(W-26 - i*30, 26);\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    ctx.moveTo(0,-10);\n    ctx.lineTo(8,10);\n    ctx.lineTo(0,5);\n    ctx.lineTo(-8,10);\n    ctx.closePath();\n    ctx.fillStyle='#3fd0ff';\n    ctx.fill();\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  if(player.rapidTimer>0){\n    ctx.fillStyle='#ffe066';\n    ctx.font='bold 14px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillText('연사 파워업 ' + player.rapidTimer.toFixed(1)+'s', 14, 64);\n  }\n\n  if(waveMessageTimer>0){\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.globalAlpha = Math.min(1, waveMessageTimer);\n    ctx.textAlign='center';\n    ctx.font='bold 34px sans-serif';\n    ctx.fillStyle='#fff';\n    ctx.fillText(waveMessage, W/2, H/2-100);\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n}\n\n// simple starfield\nlet stars = [];\nfor(let i=0;i<80;i++){\n  stars.push({x:Math.random()*W, y:Math.random()*H, s:Math.random()*2+0.5, v:20+Math.random()*60});\n}\nlet lastStarUpdate = performance.now();\nfunction drawStars(){\n  const now = performance.now();\n  const dt = Math.min(0.05,(now-lastStarUpdate)/1000);\n  lastStarUpdate = now;\n  ctx.fillStyle='#fff';\n  for(const s of stars){\n    s.y += s.v*dt;\n    if(s.y>H){ s.y=0; s.x=Math.random()*W; }\n    ctx.globalAlpha = 0.4+Math.random()*0.3;\n    ctx.fillRect(s.x, s.y, s.s, s.s);\n  }\n  ctx.globalAlpha=1;\n}\n\n// start\nresetGame();\nrequestAnimationFrame(loop);\n\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"}